      "content": "okay but if i take that side, my opponent is gonna hammer me on the idea that this just leads to a lack of accountability and basically turns the presidency into an unchecked monarchy. can you give me the strongest possible counter-argument to what you just said? i need to know if the \"erosion of checks and balances\" side actually has any real legal teeth or if it's just a political talking point.",
